        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.poster.avif?t=1786305420\" width=546 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.webm?t=1786305420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.mp4?t=1786305420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S THIS 'TIME COWBOY' ABOUT PARTNER!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIME COWBOY is a fast-paced movement shooter, where you play as Hank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Stubborn Cowboy running and gunning his way through History, trying to find out who is dragging him through it... and how to put a stop to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Note: This game contains imagery that may be harmful to those with epilepsy. )</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S IN THE GAME!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Chapters set in the Wild West, Medieval Times and The Prohibition Era with 10 levels each.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Unique Weapons <i>with their own unique abilities</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000s-Inspired Voice Acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Enemy Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Boss Fights <i>(Plus 2 Secret Bosses!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Difficulties: <i>Yellowbelly, Hard and Tuberculosis</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >640x480 Resolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 FPS Cap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO YOU CAN'T CHANGE IT.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mister Milton</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.poster.avif?t=1786305420\" width=546 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.webm?t=1786305420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.mp4?t=1786305420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S THIS 'TIME COWBOY' ABOUT PARTNER!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIME COWBOY is a fast-paced movement shooter, where you play as Hank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Stubborn Cowboy running and gunning his way through History, trying to find out who is dragging him through it... and how to put a stop to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Note: This game contains imagery that may be harmful to those with epilepsy. )</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S IN THE GAME!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Chapters set in the Wild West, Medieval Times and The Prohibition Era with 10 levels each.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Unique Weapons <i>with their own unique abilities</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000s-Inspired Voice Acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Enemy Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Boss Fights <i>(Plus 2 Secret Bosses!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Difficulties: <i>Yellowbelly, Hard and Tuberculosis</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >640x480 Resolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 FPS Cap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO YOU CAN'T CHANGE IT.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mister Milton</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
